- Backend: GET /admin/brands/{slug}/events endpoint (no user_id_hash)
- Frontend: date picker UI with quick ranges + custom date range in dashboard
- Frontend: period comparison chart (dashed line) with dynamic label
- Frontend: KPI counter animations (easeOutCubic) + fade-in card entrance
- Frontend: improved empty states with icon/title/subtitle
- Frontend: responsive mobile breakpoints (991/768/480px)
- Frontend: Chart.js v2 tooltip fix (mode nearest, dark styling)
- Frontend: admin eventos.html — real-time event log with auto-refresh (10s)
- Frontend: Eventos nav link added to all admin sidebar pages
